6. On perusal Ex.P4-wound certificate, it discloses that the petitioner has sustained following injuries:
i. Laceration with loss of tissue on the forehead; ii. Lacerated injuries over right eye brow area and below the right eye;
iii. Nasal bleed;
iv. Lacerated injury from right forehead; v. Over bridge of nose to left side of face,
laceration 3 x 1 cm over right chest;
vi. Communited fracture of lateral wall of right orbit, fracture bilateral lumina.
